WEBVTT

00:10:27.354 --> 00:10:30.741
So I brought some kids in,

00:10:31.513 --> 00:10:34.074
and this now became the standard of care,

00:10:34.098 --> 00:10:36.903
and the [Boston]
Children's Hospital was behind it.

00:10:36.927 --> 00:10:41.070
By my showing them
the kids before and after,

00:10:41.094 --> 00:10:44.915
people who never got treated
and people who wished to be treated,

00:10:44.939 --> 00:10:46.527
and pictures of the Dutch --

00:10:48.035 --> 00:10:49.256
they came to me and said,

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.487
"You've got to do
something for these kids."

00:10:51.511 --> 00:10:53.568
Well, where were these kids before?

00:10:54.774 --> 00:10:57.145
They were out there suffering,
is where they were.

00:10:57.894 --> 00:11:04.038
So we started a program in 2007.